      en: ["Karongi is known for its scenic bays and peninsulas.", "Napoleon Island hosts a large colony of fruit bats.", "Amahoro Island, known as 'Peace Island', has a small restaurant.", "A genocide memorial is located in a church in the town.", "The region is a major coffee-growing area.", "Kayaking is a popular activity.", "The coastal road offers spectacular views."],
